# Dev/test/lint tooling — supply-chain hardened (SLSA).
#
# Versions pinned to the set verified clean by pip-audit on 2026-06-14.
# Compile to a hash-locked lockfile with:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file=requirements-dev.txt requirements-dev.in
# Then every install uses `pip install --require-hashes -r requirements-dev.txt`,
# so a tampered or account-takeover release can't be substituted.
#
# ruff + detect-secrets kept in lockstep with versions.env (CI parity).
